; Nolang alias catalog: en
; Localized display names (别名) for every std function/method, keyed by
; the same doc anchor its `; [label](#anchor)` comment uses, so an alias and
; its documentation block always agree on the key. Values are short, pure
; translated names — the identifier itself remains the only spelling that
; compiles. Keys must exist as an anchor in some src/std .no source, or the
; gate rejects the catalog; `make i18n -alias-missing` lists what is left.
